sequenceDiagram
  actor Creator
  actor Approver
  participant SPA as React SPA (FinanceEntryPage)
  participant API as REST Route Layer
  participant Session as Session/Role Resolver
  participant Policy as SoD Policy
  participant ApprovalSvc as Approval Service
  participant EntryRepo as Entry Repository
  participant HistRepo as History Repository

  Creator->>SPA: Open entry page
  SPA->>API: GET /api/journal-entries/:id
  API->>Session: Resolve caller identity & roles
  Session-->>API: {userId, roles:[finance-approver]}
  API->>EntryRepo: Load entry
  EntryRepo-->>API: entry {id, createdBy, status: submitted}
  API-->>SPA: entry + caller context
  SPA->>SPA: isCreator = caller.userId === entry.createdBy
  SPA-->>Creator: Render entry page, Approve control omitted

  Creator->>API: POST /api/journal-entries/:id/approve
  API->>Session: Resolve caller identity & roles
  Session-->>API: {userId, roles:[finance-approver]}
  API->>EntryRepo: Load entry
  EntryRepo-->>API: entry {createdBy, status: submitted}
  API->>Policy: canApprove(caller, entry)
  Policy-->>API: denied (caller is creator)
  API-->>Creator: 403 Forbidden, entry.status unchanged

  Approver->>API: POST /api/journal-entries/:id/approve
  API->>Session: Resolve caller identity & roles
  Session-->>API: {userId, roles:[finance-approver]}
  API->>EntryRepo: Load entry
  EntryRepo-->>API: entry {createdBy, status: submitted}
  API->>Policy: canApprove(caller, entry)
  Policy-->>API: allowed (caller is not creator)
  API->>ApprovalSvc: approve(entry, caller)
  ApprovalSvc->>EntryRepo: update status=approved
  ApprovalSvc->>HistRepo: append decision row (approve, caller, timestamp)
  ApprovalSvc-->>API: success
  API-->>Approver: 200 OK {status: approved}
